# The memory panel's detail box shows each office's own property, and only that one: a thinking modus
# mentis its doubt (ModusMentis.Doubt) — High and Medium with the tries they get again, Low with none
# — and an acting one whether it acts discreetly. Caution thinks and does not act, so it has a Doubt
# row and no Discreet row; Stealth acts and does not think, so the reverse. Husbandry is a will
# that acts: Discreet, and no Doubt — a will is never doubted. It is also a will of five targets, the
# longest block the box holds, and its XP row must still be there.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --grant-mm caution,alchemy,impatience,stealth,husbandry --location-type test --location-id 0

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
manage Memory
wait 10

select mm caution
wait
expect Doubt High — 2 more tries
expect-not Discreet

select mm alchemy
wait
expect Doubt Medium — 1 more try

select mm impatience
wait
expect Doubt Low — no second try

select mm stealth
wait
expect Discreet Yes — acts unnoticed
expect-not Doubt

select mm husbandry
wait
expect Discreet No
expect-not Doubt
expect XP
quit
